cluster_osd - Role-based cluster OS userspace daemon skeleton

This directory provides a minimal userspace daemon implementation for a
headless role-based cluster OS model.

Roles
-----
- orchestring
- job_cluster_server
- admin

Configuration
-------------
By default, cluster_osd reads /etc/cluster_os/config.conf. This minimal daemon
accepts flat key/value lines using either `key=value` or `key: value` format
(see examples/).

Admin GUI Notifications
-----------------------
Set `admin.gui.notifications=true` to emit Server Control notifications in admin
role cycles.

Build
-----
make -C tools/cluster_os

Tests
-----
make -C tools/cluster_os test

Run one test cycle
------------------
./tools/cluster_os/cluster_osd -n -c tools/cluster_os/examples/config.admin

Admin UI mock (Server Control)
------------------------------
A static admin dashboard mock inspired by the requested style is available at:

tools/cluster_os/admin_server_control.html

Open it directly in a browser to preview:

xdg-open tools/cluster_os/admin_server_control.html
